  "notes": "{齟齬|そご} is a formal term using rare kanji ({齟|そ} and {齬|ご}, both relating to teeth not meshing). It describes situations where things don't fit or agree as they should.\n\nCommon collocations:\n- {齟齬|そご}⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{生|しょう}じる→生じる：02118_shoujiru⟧: a discrepancy arises\n- {齟齬|そご}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧きたす: to cause a discrepancy\n- ⟦{意見|いけん}→意見：01303_iken⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{齟齬|そご}: difference of opinion\n\nRelated terms:\n- ⟦{食|く}い{違|ちが}い→食い違い：09342_kuichigai⟧: discrepancy, mismatch\n- ⟦{不一致|ふいっち}→不一致：15246_fuicchi⟧: disagreement\n- ⟦{矛盾|むじゅん}→矛盾：05215_mujun⟧: contradiction",
